    "title": "Stony Brook University Professor wins Truman Capote and Gauss awards - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Press Release ,\n6 hours ago\nStony Brook University Assistant Professor of English in the College of Arts and Sciences Nicholas Boggs was recently awarded the Truman Capote Literary Trust Award for Literary Criticism from the Iowa Writer’s Workshop, receiving a $30,000 prize. Boggs is being honored for his biography, Baldwin: A Love Story (2025)....\nRead full article",
